  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### National Insurance information\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 6 Apr, 2023 at  8:15 AM\n\n\t\tTo run payroll reports in Capium and ensure national insurance contributions have been met.\n\nHelp/Guide\n\nNavigation: Payroll > Reports > Periodic Tax and NI \n\nTo ensure that all tax and national insurance contributions are met, a user needs to follow navigation process and select a period of the report shown on the screenshot above.\n\nOnce it has been done, a user is able to see Employer’s payment record including tax and national insurance contributions. P.S. Capium calculates contributions automatically on a regular basis, based on the UK legislation rules. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
