-serif;\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9180968484/original/90_QCus9PcaIIlWYW24LbwESDjhCbkr6dA.png?1677500692\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9180968484\"></span></strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">To ensure that all tax and national insurance contributions are met, a user needs to follow navigation process and select a period of the report shown on the screenshot above.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9180968632/original/X4Mn9wc678KFz1tX-4Wccdt8VNGRvTt1yA.png?1677500793\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9180968632\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9180968688/original/GxvRAPjWRbZUc9jZCUfGpE_6FTQACzFV5w.png?1677500831\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9180968688\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">Once it has been done, a user is able to see Employer’s payment record including tax and national insurance contributions. P.S. Capium calculates contributions automatically on a regular basis, based on the UK legislation rules.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; li